'''Ezekial Lovecraft''' sells and buys fish and bait in the town of [[Witchaven]]. He sells all normal [[Fishing]] equipment from his shop called [[Lovecraft's Tackle]].

His skin is a sickly yellow colour, similar to the villagers possessed by [[sea slug (race)|sea slug]]s, but he lacks the gills and bulging eyes that they also possess. He claims to have looked like this since before [[Mayor Hobb]] was possessed, and speculates the Mayor's current speaking patterns and appearance to be the result of recognizing how much Ezekial admires him, and that he has come to admire Ezekial in turn.{{CiteNPC|npc=Ezekial Lovecraft|quote=Really? That's the nicest thing anyone has ever said. I admire him a great deal. He works so hard for this town. ... Hmm, I don't think I do. ... Well, I haven't spoken to him in a while. I don't get out much. ... Maybe the Mayor has finally seen how much I admire him and has grown to admire me? ... Hey, I resent that!|loc=The Slug Menace}}{{CiteNPC|npc=Player character|quote=You know, you sound just like the mayor? ... You look like him as well? ... I can see why ... No really, what with the unhealthy skin tone and bulging eyes. The resemblance is uncanny. ... Anything's possible I suppose. Wait a minute, you mean you've always looked that odd?|loc=The Slug Menace}}

==Slug Menace==
During the [[Slug Menace]] [[quest]], he gives the player [[page 2]] of [[Brother Maledict]]'s holy book, which he mysteriously received by someone who pushed it under his door, most likely agents of the [[Sea Slugs]] like [[Mayor Hobb]], Brother Maledict, or [[Col. Jake O'Niall]] as these pages are used to craft special runes to be used as keys to free [[Mother Mallum]] from her imprisonment.

