==Strategy==
Like most barbarians from Barbarian Village (except for [[Litara]], [[Hunding]], [[Atlas]], and [[Peksa]]), he will attack the player if talked to. Players who attack him using [[Ranged]] or [[Magic]] can do so safely from behind the tables or stools. His defences are very low, and he is weakest to [[Magic]]. If a player accidentally clicks the "Talk-to" option on him but does not want to fight him, they can click somewhere else on the map to avoid the battle. Gunthor will only engage if the player finishes the conversation.

