'''Harpoon Joe''' (called '''Joe''' in-game) is a barman who sells [[jug of wine|wine]], [[Braindeath 'rum'|'rum']], [[beer]] and [[stew]] in his pub, [[Harpoon Joe's House of 'Rum'.]] on [[Mos Le'Harmless]]. He is not very welcoming to patrons who do not wish to purchase anything from him, and asks them to "Stop takin' up me floor space". Players need to have a [[book o' piracy]] when trying to trade with him, otherwise he will respond with unintelligible pirate slang.

