[[File:Old Man Ral chathead.png|left]]
'''Old Man Ral''' is an elderly man found near the entrance of [[Meiyerditch]]. Old Man Ral is something of a sage within Meiyerditch, and regularly uses his knowledge to help both the [[Myreque]] and the ghetto's residents. He has knowledge of the Myreque operating in Meiyerditch, and during the [[Darkness of Hallowvale]] quest he shows players how to navigate Meiyerditch by following secret pathways.

Ral plays a small role in the [[Darkness of Hallowvale]] [[quest]]. After players compliment him, he tells them the location of the northern [[Sanguinesti region|Sanguinesti]] [[Myreque Hideout]]. He can only be helpful after the player has spoken to a citizen about him.

He can be tricky to locate for the first time during Darkness of Hallowvale. He resides in a building down an alleyway north-east of the wall where you land the boat to access Meiyerditch along with a few other citizens (three buildings north of the wall rubble that you climb over; also one building north of [[Trader Sven]]).

After the Meiyerditch hideout is compromised during [[A Taste of Hope]], his basement is used as a hideout for the surviving Myreque throughout [[Sins of the Father]], and when [[Ivan Strom]] leaves the hideout during [[The Blood Moon Rises]], Old Man Ral takes up his role of providing [[Drakan's medallion]]s and selling [[Old Man Ral's Supplies|supplies]].

==Treasure Trails==
{{Anagram|Old Man Ral|master|MOLD LA RAN}}. He will give you either a [[light box|light]] or [[puzzle box]] to solve.

The fastest way to get to him is via the [[Drakan's medallion]]'s [[Ver Sinhaza]] teleport. Just run slightly south-west out of the doors, then further west to his house.

An alternative route is via [[Burgh de Rott]]. Take the Boat south of Burgh de Rott to [[Meiyerditch]], navigate the agility shortcuts, and then run north.

