'''Oziach''' is a master smith with ties to the [[Champions' Guild]]. He lives just north-west of [[Edgeville]] and, during [[Dragon Slayer I]], informs applicants to the Guild where the three [[map part]]s to [[Crandor]] can be found. Afterwards, he sells [[Rune platebody|rune platebodies]], [[Green dragonhide body|green dragonhide bodies]] and [[anti-dragon shield]]s from [[Oziach (shop)|his shop]].

Oziach appears to wear a bulkier version of the [[rune platebody]] with alternate colouring. Along with the [[Hero]], he is the only other NPC wearing alternatively coloured [[Rune equipment|Rune armour]].

Players lucky enough to obtain a [[draconic visage]], and who do not have a [[Smithing]] level of 90 or higher, can pay Oziach {{Coins|1,250,000}} coins to combine the draconic visage with an [[anti-dragon shield]], making a [[dragonfire shield]]. Similarly, he can do the same with a [[skeletal visage]], combining it with an anti-dragon shield for the same price to create a [[dragonfire ward]].

