[[File:Prospector Percy chathead.png|left]]
'''Prospector Percy''' is the discoverer of the [[Motherlode Mine]] and owner of [[Prospector Percy's Nugget Shop]]. Players can trade him [[golden nugget]]s for components of the [[prospector outfit]] and other items such as the [[coal bag]] and [[gem bag]]. He also sells an increase to the paydirt sack capacity, access to the upper section of the Motherlode Mine and use of the upper floor [[Hopper (Motherlode Mine)|hopper]]. Despite his close proximity to a hammer and the water wheels, he won't fix them himself and will simply announce when they break. 

==Treasure Trails==
{{Anagram|Percy|hard|[[Clue scroll (hard) - COPPER ORE CRYPTS|COPPER ORE CRYPTS]]}}. He will give the player a [[challenge scroll]], the answer to which is '''12'''.

==Stock==
The [[bag full of gems]] and [[soft clay pack]]s are unique to this shop, meaning that the versions of these items bought elsewhere cannot be resold here.
{{StoreTableHead|sellmultiplier=1000|buymultiplier=800|delta=0|currency=Golden nugget|column1=Exp boost|column2=Boost per nugget|hidege=yes|bucket=No}}
{{StoreLine|name=Prospector helmet|bucketname=Prospector helmet#Motherlode Mine|restock=1|stock=100|column1=0.4%|column2=0.010%/{{plinkp|Golden nugget}}|gemw=no}}
{{StoreLine|name=Prospector jacket|bucketname=Prospector jacket#Motherlode Mine|restock=1|stock=100|column1=0.8%|column2=0.013%/{{plinkp|Golden nugget}}|gemw=no}}
{{StoreLine|name=Prospector legs|bucketname=Prospector legs#Motherlode Mine|restock=1|stock=100|column1=0.6%|column2=0.012%/{{plinkp|Golden nugget}}|gemw=no}}
{{StoreLine|name=Prospector boots|bucketname=Prospector boots#Motherlode Mine|restock=1|stock=100|column1=0.2%|column2=0.007%/{{plinkp|Golden nugget}}|gemw=no}}
